The existing color-coding and application workflow are preserved as part of the demonstrated implementation.

---

# 📈 Why This Matters

The core idea is not simply:

> "Ask AI to write code."

The workflow is:

> **Give AI the right repository context, identify what the change actually touches, implement deliberately, and verify the resulting behavior.**

This makes Shift Handover Pro a demonstration of **AI-assisted software maintenance and legacy modernization**, rather than a simple code-generation application.

