# 🚀 Running Locally

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/khushichoudhary950/shift-handover-pro-bob.git
cd shift-handover-pro-bob
```

Install the project dependencies according to the repository configuration.

Run the development server using the project's configured command.

> Replace the commands below with the exact commands defined in `package.json` before publishing this README.

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Then open the local development URL displayed by the development server.

---

# 🔐 Security & Deployment

The live demonstration is deployed through **Netlify**.

Before publishing the repository:

- Do not commit API keys.
- Do not commit Supabase service-role credentials.
- Use environment variables for private configuration.
- Verify that `.env` files are included in `.gitignore`.
- Check that no personal credentials or private repository information are present.
- Use public/demo-safe credentials and data only.

