# ⚠️ Scope & Limitations

Shift Handover Pro is a demonstration of an AI-assisted maintenance workflow.

The demonstrated result should not be interpreted as proof that AI can guarantee complete semantic equivalence or production safety for arbitrary repositories.

The workflow is designed around the specific application, repository context, and maintenance scenario demonstrated in this project.

Human review remains important before applying maintenance changes to production systems.

